    "description": "No more worrying about lost files, easily recover deleted photos and videos.\r\n\r\nFile Recovery is the ultimate solution for recovering lost or accidentally deleted files. Designed with a friendly and easy-to-use interface, the application helps you quickly retrieve important photos and videos.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Photo recovery: Losing photos is the biggest obsession of many mobile users. File Recovery helps you easily restore these precious photos with a few simple steps.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Video Recovery: Besides photos, the app also helps you recover deleted videos simply and effectively. All deleted videos will be found and restored\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Fast and Deep Scan: The app provides a comprehensive scan to search for lost files throughout the memory for quick recovery.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Preview photos and videos: Before deciding to restore a file, you can preview the file's content to make sure you choose the right file to restore.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Easy to use: With File Recovery, recovering photos and videos is not so easy. Intuitive and easy-to-use interface helps users quickly perform the recovery process, no need for high technical skills.\r\n\r\nFile Recovery is an indispensable tool for every mobile user. With the ability to recover a variety of file types, this app helps you retrieve important data quickly and effectively.\r\n\r\nInstall and use the app for free today to eliminate worries about losing photos and videos.",
